SPECIFICITY: SPECIFIC

1. Strongman Striker Gameplay Refinement — Introduce a new "Sabotaged Mallet" variant where the mallet head breaks off after 3 swings, reducing effectiveness and requiring players to swap it with a replacement found in hidden mini-rooms.
2. Strongman High Striker Modifiers — Add a new modifier called "Unstable Lever" which causes the lever to wobble violently when swung, making it harder for players to achieve precise timing.
3. Strongman Stronger Strikes System — Implement a system where successful hits on the bell at higher difficulty tiers grant bonus Soul Tokens, but with increased randomness in the puck's trajectory and tower gauge shifts.

