### Mechanic: Modifier Loop & Impulse Application
INTENT: every frame read random friction/mass variants from AttractionConstants.modifiers then apply mallet swing impulse and launch puck with AddLinearVelocity
PSEUDO:
  if not IsSensorTriggered(bell_sensor) then
    friction = AttractionConstants.modifiers.friction or 0.5
    puck_mass = AttractionConstants.modifiers.weight or 5.0
    swing_force = AttractionConstants.modifiers.power * mallet_integrity
    ApplyImpulse(mallet, 0, swing_force, 0)
    puck_vel = GetVelocity(mallet) * swing_force / puck_mass
    AddLinearVelocity(puck, puck_vel.x, puck_vel.y, puck_vel.z)
    current_streak = Engine.GetStreak()
    friction = friction * (1 - (current_streak * 0.05))
    if friction < 0.2 then
      SetFriction(rail_friction, friction)
    end
  end
